1
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:11,350
Say good-bye, loneliness.

2
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:18,200
The rest of the dream I'd almost forgotten...

3
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,100
Once again.

4
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:32,650
The wind at dawn was sad.

5
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:35,300
I felt as though I'd fall apart.

6
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,800
Where is love?

7
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,400
I need love.

8
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:43,500
I want someone to understand me,

9
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:47,800
but no one does. I'm torn.

10
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:51,500
Always...

11
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:57,350
I always kept my pain hidden,

12
00:00:57,350 --> 00:01:00,300
in my soul.

13
00:01:01,150 --> 00:01:03,750
Say good-bye, loneliness.

14
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:06,500
I'm glad I met you

15
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:10,600
in this rusted city.

16
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:14,100
Time to say good-bye, loneliness.

17
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:18,350
Let's make just a tiny opening,

18
00:01:18,350 --> 00:01:22,550
and open our hearts.

19
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:45,100
I was afraid someone would scold me,

20
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:48,100
so I just kept holding back my tears.

21
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:50,400
Where is love?

22
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,250
I need love.

23
00:01:52,250 --> 00:01:56,100
You gave me something special.

24
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:59,400
My false self and my past

25
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:02,400
all fade away.

26
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:06,200
Always... I was searching

27
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:11,300
for the strength never to lose,

28
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:13,550
in my soul.

29
00:02:13,550 --> 00:02:16,550
Say good-bye, loneliness.

30
00:02:16,550 --> 00:02:20,000
Let's see the rest of the dream

31
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:24,000
I'd almost forgotten.

32
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,300
Time to say good-bye, loneliness.

33
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:31,700
I won't let life carry me along,

34
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:36,100
as long as I'm with you.
